§ 81. Haec et *omnia* his similia, quae Simon
Magus, Nicolaus, Cerinthus <NOTE N="65" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0077" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0077"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Cherindus:</HI>  Ed. Bas. —  <HI REND="ITALIC">Thervidus:</HI> 
